# Normalize line endings so a Windows student's CRLF checkout does not make
# every line a formatting diff. `text=auto` applies on renormalization; the
# explicit `eol=lf` overrides for C++ sources, the Makefile, and Abseil's
# platform `.inc` implementation files (vendored under abseil/).
* text=auto
*.cpp text eol=lf
*.h   text eol=lf
*.inc text eol=lf
Makefile text eol=lf
